{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》 主要演員包括：楊茜堯、陳豪、林夏薇、馬國明、陳展鵬、姚子羚、傅嘉莉、陳自瑤、鄺潔楹等。</p><p>昨晚（25日）播出的第十二集「名媛陷脅」，有兩大精彩場口。</p><p>首先「最強小三」陳楨怡，着懷有陳展鵬骨肉登堂入室，直指向正印傅嘉莉挑機。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:43:58.705320+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:40:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:37:16.337509+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:37:16.337509+00:00","content_hash":"8704fc2333e93fe3c2847c124d7e54f8bca576ff635ce494b131a61ab7f227f0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}